   181	  // Opaque symbolic projections of the exhaustive scan.  K's Haskell backend
   182	  // has no symbolic IEEE-754 evaluator, so forcing scanPairsVS underneath
   183	  // pair projections would enumerate an unbounded symbolic list.  These
   184	  // projections name that same scan result without evaluating it.
